    "prompt": "Read the following passage and answer the question by choosing the best option. Provide only the text of the correct option as your answer.\n\nPassage: Everyone has that friend who instigates a wild night out, encourages you to have one drink too many, but gets you home in one piece. Now there's a 'smart beer mug' that does a similar thing. Fitted with sensors, the ePint lights up when it is empty, keeps track of the number of drinks its user has sunk and can even suggest ordering a cab at the end of the night. Start-up Xtreme Tech, based in Los Angeles, California, is raising money to put the gadget into production on Kickstarter. The firm audaciously describes its invention as 'Vegas in a cup'.\n@highlight\nePint contains sensors, LEDs and a Bluetooth chip to link to a phone\n@highlight\nIt lights up to show when it is empty or when a sports team has scored\n@highlight\nApp features let users play drinking games and even order a cab home\n@highlight\nGadget is available to pre-order via Kickstarter from $30 (£20)\nQuery: The ePint also has a built-in weight sensor to track how much liquid it is holding, accelerometers and @placeholder that flash and change colour, as well as a bottle opener so it can be filled with beer quickly.\n\nOptions : A. App\nB. Kickstarter\nC. Bluetooth\nD. California\nE. LEDs\nF. Gadget\nG. Los Angeles\nH. Vegas\nI. Xtreme Tech\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the contetn of the correct option. ",
