    "global index": "QANTA_Science_308",
    "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: This phenomenon is exhibited by the rotation of a water wheel with leaky buckets.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-Next",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The phenomenon is **positive feedback**. In a water wheel with leaky buckets, as the wheel rotates, water leaks out of the buckets, reducing their weight on the descending side and shifting the center of mass, which increases the torque and accelerates rotation—a self-reinforcing cycle. This contrasts with negative feedback, which would stabilize the system.  \n\\boxed{positive feedback}",
