    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Luke is guided by the spirit of Obi-Wan Kenobi, who speaks to him during the final attack, urging him to trust the Force. This spiritual guidance, combined with Luke’s growing connection to the Force, allows him to shut out external distractions and fire the torpedoes with precision. The result is the successful destruction of the Death Star.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The spirit of Obi-Wan Kenobi}}",
