    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The provided context does not mention the princess using her influence for any action. The excerpt describes the king’s arena and the trial system but does not include details about the princess or her actions. Therefore, based on the given text, it is not possible to determine what the princess uses her influence to do. \n\n\\boxed{\\text{The context does not specify what the princess uses her influence to do.}}",
