    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Diane will know the hit man has killed Camilla when she finds the blue key, as he explicitly tells her that the key will be her signal upon completion of the job. The key matches the one found in Rita’s purse earlier, tying the two narrative layers together as a psychological symbol of the murder’s aftermath. When Diane retrieves the key, her subsequent hallucinations and suicide confirm she interprets it as the confirmation of Camilla’s death.  \n$\\boxed{\\text{She will find the blue key.}}$",
