    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Adam finally gets rid of his cancer by undergoing a risky surgery after his chemotherapy fails to stop the tumor’s growth. The surgery successfully removes the tumor, despite the surgeon noting worse-than-expected bone degradation. Adam recovers fully, as confirmed by the doctor after the operation.  \n\\boxed{\\text{He undergoes a successful risky surgery to remove the tumor.}}",
