n Africans utilized trading contacts with Europeans to spread their cultural influence throughout Europe.\nJ. Sub-Saharan Africans engaged in trade with Europeans to acquire new agricultural techniques.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
