      "generated_answer": "The passage by John Kerry highlights opposition to U.S. involvement in Vietnam and critiques American intervention, aligning with central concerns of the Counterculture Movement. That movement was primarily focused on ending the Vietnam War and supporting the civil rights movement as key political issues. Therefore, the correct answer is:\n\n\\boxed{H}",
